; win7-shims/win7_stubs.def
; 强制链接器保留 win7-shims 的 #[no_mangle] stub 符号。
; 符号名必须与 Rust 函数名完全一致（大小写敏感）。
EXPORTS
    WakeByAddressSingle
    WakeByAddressAll
    WaitOnAddress
    RtlWaitOnAddress
    RtlWakeAddressSingle
    RtlWakeAddressAll
    CoIncrementMTAUsage
    CoTaskMemAlloc
    CoTaskMemFree
    CoCreateFreeThreadedMarshaler
    RoGetAgileReference
    ProcessPrng
    GetSystemTimePreciseAsFileTime
    DiscardVirtualMemory
    GetCurrentThreadStackLimits
    GetThreadDescription
    SetThreadDescription
    EventSetInformation
